The Build Useful design system

editor's interface follows the Build Useful design system, used under its own
licence. The design system is not vendored into this repository: its colour,
type, space, shape and motion tokens are implemented natively (see
viewcore/include/theme.hpp), as the design system's web CSS/JS is not copied
into a native app (PLAN.md D13).

